 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "text contains ASCII letters and spaces; words are maximal runs of letters. Count words case-insensitively (as lower-case). Take the k largest distinct frequencies (all of them when there are fewer than k). Return [word, frequency] for every word whose frequency is one of them, ordered by frequency descending, then word ascending in code-point order. Text with no words gives an empty list.",
